      "output": {
        "message": "Right now, the best move is to keep things simple and focus on getting through the next 24 to 48 hours: 1. **Pause on major talks or decisions.** Unless you share living arrangements or immediate logistics that can't wait, hold off on texting, re-hashing the conversation, or making big sudden changes today. Give the shock a moment to settle.\n2. **Cover the physical basics.** High stress tends to wreck routines. Make sure you drink water, eat at least one decent meal, and get some rest, even if you can't sleep well yet.\n3. **Pick one reliable outlet.** If you don't want to be alone with your thoughts, reach out to one dependable friend or family member just to be around someone safe. If you prefer quiet, keep today's to-do list to the absolute bare minimum. Take it one hour at a time for now. If there are pressing practical details you have to handle right away—like a shared lease or shared stuff—we can break those down whenever you're ready.",
